WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.088
Who owns this?

2
00:00:01.088 --> 00:00:04.317
The endpoint engineer owns the Intune app,

3
00:00:04.317 --> 00:00:08.562
the DNS-over-HTTPS profile,
and the hardening from ring 2.

4
00:00:08.562 --> 00:00:13.349
The help desk uses the client's collect
logs and health check before escalating.

5
00:00:13.349 --> 00:00:15.687
The policy owner approves exclusions,

6
00:00:15.687 --> 00:00:19.850
and the security officer keeps the
runs and the health check exports.

7
00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:24.525
The fleet read needs only Network
Access Policy Read All, delegated.

8
00:00:24.525 --> 00:00:29.300
The device script runs as an administrator
on a test device and only reads.

9
00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:34.200
And the in-scope count comes from Intune,
with its date, in the settings file.
